<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Wednesday, Jan 15 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts.</p>
<p>(in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Wednesday    Jan 15   $68.56    up 0.03</p>
<p>Tuesday	Jan 14   $68.53    up 0.05</p>
</text>
